  "description": "Given a root node reference of a BST and a key, delete the node with the given key in the BST. Return the root node reference.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "1: if !root return null\n2: if key < root.val: root.left = delete(root.left, key)\n3: else if key > root.val: root.right = delete(root.right, key)\n4: else:\n5:   if !root.left: return root.right\n6:   if !root.right: return root.left\n7:   temp = findMin(root.right)\n8:   root.val = temp.val\n9:   root.right = delete(root.right, temp.val)\n10: return root",
